          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வறுமை (vaṟumai) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5513 lists it in the family of veṟu, \"empty\", with veṟumai, \"emptiness, poverty\": an empty hand."
