            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சமூகத்தில் ஏற்றத்தாழ்வு குறைய வேண்டும். camūkattil ēṟṟattāḻvu kuṟaiya vēṇṭum. Inequality in society must come down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally a rising and a falling (தாழ்வு): highs and lows."
            }
          ]
        },
