              "text": "ஏற்றத்தாழ்வு (ēṟṟattāḻvu) is native: ēṟṟam, \"mounting, rising\", from ēṟu, \"to rise\" (DEDR 916), and tāḻvu, \"lowness\", from tāḻ, \"to be low\" (DEDR 3178)."
