              "text": "அந்த முதலாளி தொழிலாளர்களைச் சுரண்டினார். anta mutalāḷi toḻilāḷarkaḷaic curaṇṭiṉār. That employer exploited the workers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): சுரண்டினேன், curaṇṭiṉēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Who is exploited takes -ஐ. Its first sense is to scrape, as a burnt pot is scraped clean."
            }
          ]
        },
